{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Clinical, calm aromatherapy contact and session planner. Learn, plan, and join ongoing scent support.">
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#fbf7f2;
      --card:#fff7ef;
      --muted:#6b5a4a;
      --accent:#b86b3a;
      --accent-2:#d0a374;
      --ink:#2f2a26;
      --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
      --radius:14px;
      --maxw:980px;
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#fff);color:var(--ink);margin:0}
    .page{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:32px auto;padding:28px;border-radius:20px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.85),rgba(255,250,244,0.9));box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(45,35,30,0.08);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:60px;height:60px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:grid;place-items:center;color:white;font-weight:700}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin:0 8px;font-size:15px}
    nav a.primary{background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px}

    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:18px;margin-top:24px}
    .intro{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(184,107,58,0.06),rgba(208,163,116,0.04));padding:18px;border-radius:12px}
    h1{margin:0;font-size:28px}
    p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin:8px 0 0}

    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 380px;gap:20px;margin-top:18px}
    .card{background:var(--card);padding:18px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(45,35,30,0.04)}

    label{display:block;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px}
    input,select,textarea{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(47,42,38,0.06);font-size:15px;background:white}
    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    button{background:var(--accent);border:none;color:white;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;cursor:pointer}

    .reveal{opacity:1;transform:none;transition:opacity 600ms ease,transform 600ms cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.3,1)}
    .hidden{opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px)}
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
      .reveal{transition:none !important}
      .hidden{opacity:1;transform:none}
    }

    /* Session planner specifics */
    .planner .row{display:flex;gap:8px}
    .tags{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .pill{background:rgba(0,0,0,0.04);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;font-size:13px}
    pre.output{white-space:pre-wrap;background:#fff6ee;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px dashed rgba(47,42,38,0.06);margin-top:10px}

    footer{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    /* small screens */
    @media (max-width:900px){
      .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .logo{width:48px;height:48px}
    }
    /* subtle decorative svg background */
    .pattern{position:absolute;right:-40px;top:-40px;opacity:0.08;pointer-events:none}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page">
    <svg class="pattern" width="240" height="240" viewBox="0 0 240 240" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
      <defs>
        <linearGradient id="g1" x1="0" x2="1">
          <stop offset="0" stop-color="#b86b3a" stop-opacity="0.9"/>
          <stop offset="1" stop-color="#d0a374" stop-opacity="0.7"/>
        </linearGradient>
      </defs>
      <g fill="url(#g1)">
        <rect x="0" y="0" width="240" height="240" rx="24"/>
        <g fill="#fff" opacity="0.06">
          <circle cx="48" cy="48" r="36"/>
          <circle cx="180" cy="96" r="26"/>
        </g>
      </g>
    </svg>
    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo" aria-hidden="true">SC</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div class="small">Clinical calm aromatherapy — evidence-aware practice</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="Primary navigation">
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
        <a href="blends.html">Custom Blends</a>
        <a href="shop.html">Boutique</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Plans</a>
        <a href="about.html">About</a>
        <a href="book.html">Schedule</a>
        <a href="contact.html" class="primary">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero hidden" data-reveal>
        <div class="intro card">
          <h1>Connect for guidance and ongoing scent support</h1>
          <p class="lead">If you'd like focused consultations, membership-style circle access, or a tailored blend, reach out. We keep safety first and practical application central.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="grid">
        <div>
          <section class="card hidden" data-reveal>
            <h2 style="margin-top:0">Get in touch</h2>
            <p class="small">Tell us how you prefer to connect. We’ll follow up within 2–3 business days with availability and a brief intake.</p>
            <form id="contactForm" onsubmit="return false;" style="margin-top:12px">
              <label for="name">Your name</label>
              <input id="name" name="name" placeholder="First and last" required>

              <label for="email">Email</label>
              <input id="email" name="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required>

              <label for="phone">Phone (optional)</label>
              <input id="phone" name="phone" placeholder="{{PHONE}}">

              <label for="message">A brief note</label>
              <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="4" placeholder="What would you like support with?"> </textarea>

              <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:12px;align-items:center">
                <button id="sendBtn">Send request</button>
                <div class="small">Or call <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong> — or email <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
              </div>
            </form>
          </section>

          <section class="card hidden" data-reveal style="margin-top:14px">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0">Practical hours &amp; location</h3>
            <p class="small">Sessions are offered in-person in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} and virtually. Availability varies by plan; scheduling links are provided after initial contact.</p>
            <div style="margin-top:8px" class="small">
              Office hours: Mon–Fri, 9:00–17:00
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="card hidden" data-reveal style="margin-top:14px">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0">Quick links</h3>
            <div class="tags" style="margin-top:8px">
              <a class="pill" href="book.html">Schedule a session</a>
              <a class="pill" href="pricing.html">View ongoing plans</a>
              <a class="pill" href="blends.html">Browse blends</a>
            </div>
          </section>
        </div>

        <aside>
          <div class="card hidden planner" data-reveal>
            <h3 style="margin-top:0">Session Planner</h3>
            <p class="small">Build a short, clinical plan for a single aromatherapy session or a repeating support circle. Export a copy you can paste into email or bring to a session.</p>

            <form id="plannerForm" onsubmit="return false;">
              <label for="goal">Primary goal</label>
              <select id="goal">
                <option value="calm">Calm / stress ease</option>
                <option value="focus">Focus / clarity</option>
                <option value="sleep">Sleep support</option>
                <option value="energize">Gentle energizing</option>
                <option value="mood">Elevated mood</option>
              </select>

              <label for="duration">Session length</label>
              <select id="duration">
                <option value="10">10 minutes — quick practice</option>
                <option value="20">20 minutes — focused session</option>
                <option value="45">45 minutes — consultation + practice</option>
              </select>

              <label for="preference">Scent profile preference</label>
              <select id="preference">
                <option value="floral">Soft floral / green</option>
                <option value="citrus">Bright citrus</option>
                <option value="woody">Warm woody / resinous</option>
                <option value="herbal">Fresh herbal</option>
                <option value="none">No preference</option>
              </select>

              <label for="notes">Relevant notes (pets, pregnancy, meds, sensitivities)</label>
              <textarea id="notes" rows="3" placeholder="Include any safety considerations"> </textarea>

              <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px">
                <button id="buildBtn">Compose plan</button>
                <button id="clearBtn" type="button" style="background:#e6c7b0;color:var(--ink)">Reset</button>
              </div>

              <pre id="output" class="output" aria-live="polite">Your session summary will appear here.</pre>
              <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px">
                <button id="copyBtn" type="button">Copy summary</button>
                <a id="emailLink" style="margin-left:auto;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">Email-ready</a>
              </div>
            </form>

            <script>
              (function(){
                const reduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
                const form = document.getElementById('plannerForm');
                const buildBtn = document.getElementById('buildBtn');
                const clearBtn = document.getElementById('clearBtn');
                const output = document.getElementById('output');
                const copyBtn = document.getElementById('copyBtn');
                const emailLink = document.getElementById('emailLink');

                function chooseAromas(goal, profile){
                  // conservative, safety-forward suggestions. No medical claims.
                  const library = {
                    calm:['Lavender', 'Roman chamomile', 'Sweet orange'],
                    focus:['Rosemary', 'Basil', 'Lemon'],
                    sleep:['Lavender', 'Cedarwood', 'Marjoram'],
                    energize:['Grapefruit','Peppermint','Sweet orange'],
                    mood:['Bergamot','Ylang ylang','Orange']
                  };
                  const byProfile = {
                    floral:['Lavender','Ylang ylang','Roman chamomile'],
                    citrus:['Sweet orange','Bergamot','Grapefruit'],
                    woody:['Cedarwood','Vetiver','Frankincense'],
                    herbal:['Rosemary','Basil','Peppermint']
                  };
                  const base = library[goal] || library['calm'];
                  const prof = byProfile[profile] || [];
                  // merge, keep unique and short
                  const merge = base.concat(prof).filter((v,i,a)=>a.indexOf(v)===i).slice(0,3);
                  return merge;
                }

                function percentMix(list){
                  // simple 3-part mix heuristic
                  const parts = list.length || 1;
                  const base = Math.floor(100/parts);
                  const arr = list.map((_,i)=> base + (i===0? (100 - base*parts) : 0));
                  return arr;
                }

                function makeSummary(){
                  const goal = document.getElementById('goal').value;
                  const duration = document.getElementById('duration').value;
                  const pref = document.getElementById('preference').value;
                  const notes = document.getElementById('notes').value.trim();

                  const aroms = chooseAromas(goal,pref);
                  const mix = percentMix(aroms);

                  const lines = [];
                  lines.push('Session plan — ' + (new Date()).toLocaleDateString());
                  lines.push('Primary goal: ' + goal.replace(/^[a-z]/,c=>c.toUpperCase()));
                  lines.push('Length: ' + duration + ' minutes');
                  lines.push('Scent profile: ' + (pref==='none'? 'no preference' : pref));
                  lines.push('---');
                  lines.push('Suggested aroma blend (approx. percentages):');

                  aroms.forEach((a,i)=>{
                    lines.push('- ' + a + ': ' + mix[i] + '%');
                  });

                  lines.push('---');
                  lines.push('Application notes:');
                  lines.push('- Dilute essential oils appropriately for topical use (common clinical starting point: 1–2% for adults).');
                  lines.push('- Perform a patch test 24 hours before topical use.');
                  lines.push('- For inhalation, use a diffuser or a single-drop inhaler; avoid prolonged high-concentration exposure.');

                  if(notes){
                    lines.push('Safety notes provided: ' + notes);
                  } else {
                    lines.push('No additional safety notes provided. Please disclose pregnancy, pets at home, or medication to your practitioner.');
                  }

                  lines.push('Suggested follow-up: brief check-in after first session to adjust dilution or oil choices.');
                  lines.push('Membership-style support: consider joining a Support Circle for ongoing practice and access to monthly blends.');

                  return lines.join('\n');
                }

                buildBtn.addEventListener('click',function(){
                  const text = makeSummary();
                  output.textContent = text;
                  emailLink.href = 'mailto:{{EMAIL}}?subject=' + encodeURIComponent('Session plan') + '&body=' + encodeURIComponent(text);
                  emailLink.textContent = 'Prepare email to ' + '{{EMAIL}}';
                });

                clearBtn.addEventListener('click',function(){
                  form.reset();
                  output.textContent = 'Your session summary will appear here.';
                  emailLink.removeAttribute('href');
                  emailLink.textContent = 'Email-ready';
                });

                copyBtn.addEventListener('click',function(){
                  const text = output.textContent;
                  if(!text) return;
                  navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText ? navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(()=>{
                    copyBtn.textContent = 'Copied';
                    setTimeout(()=>copyBtn.textContent = 'Copy summary',1200);
                  }).catch(()=>{
                    // fallback
                    const ta = document.createElement('textarea');ta.value=text;document.body.appendChild(ta);ta.select();try{document.execCommand('copy');copyBtn.textContent='Copied'}catch(e){alert('Copy failed')};document.body.removeChild(ta);
                  }) : alert('Copy not supported');
                });

                // mild accessibility: allow Enter on form to build
                form.addEventListener('keydown',function(e){ if(e.key==='Enter' && (e.ctrlKey||e.metaKey)){ e.preventDefault(); buildBtn.click(); } });

                // initial reset
                output.textContent = 'Your session summary will appear here.';
              })();
            </script>

          </div>

          <div class="card hidden" data-reveal style="margin-top:14px">
            <h4 style="margin-top:0">Safety &amp; expectations</h4>
            <p class="small">All plans emphasize conservative dilution and mention patch testing. We tailor recommendations when you disclose pregnancy, breastfeeding, medications, or household animals.</p>
            <a href="#faq" class="small">Read the FAQ below →</a>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </section>

      <section id="faq" class="card hidden" data-reveal style="margin-top:18px">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0">FAQs — Safety-forward notes</h3>
        <details>
          <summary style="cursor:pointer">How do you handle dilution and topical use?</summary>
          <div class="small" style="margin-top:8px">Recommendations are conservative: adult topical dilutions commonly start around 1–2% for short-term use unless otherwise directed. Specific dilutions are determined during intake. Always perform a 24-hour patch test before broader topical use.</div>
        </details>

        <details style="margin-top:8px">
          <summary style="cursor:pointer">Are essential oils safe around pets?</summary>
          <div class="small" style="margin-top:8px">Some volatile oils can affect animals differently. We ask about pets in the intake and provide alternative suggestions. Diffusion should be limited in time and space, and animals should have access to leave the area.</div>
        </details>

        <details style="margin-top:8px">
          <summary style="cursor:pointer">Pregnancy and nursing</summary>
          <div class="small" style="margin-top:8px">If you are pregnant, trying to conceive, or breastfeeding, disclose this on intake. Some oils are avoided in pregnancy. We use evidence-aware guidance and will adapt recommendations accordingly.</div>
        </details>

        <details style="margin-top:8px">
          <summary style="cursor:pointer">Do you make medical claims?</summary>
          <div class="small" style="margin-top:8px">No medical claims are made. Aromatic practices may support feelings of calm, focus, or comfort; they are not a substitute for medical advice or treatment.</div>
        </details>
      </section>

      <footer class="card" style="margin-top:18px">
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:700">Ready to connect?</div>
          <div class="small">Click to schedule or use the form above and we’ll reply to arrange a welcome conversation.</div>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align:right">
          <a class="small" href="book.html" style="display:inline-block;margin-bottom:6px">Schedule a welcome visit</a>
          <div><a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
        </div>
      </footer>

    </main>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Scroll-triggered reveal with reduced-motion respect
    (function(){
      const prefersReduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
      const els = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('[data-reveal]'));
      els.forEach(el=> el.classList.add('hidden'));
      if(prefersReduced){ els.forEach(el=> el.classList.remove('hidden','reveal')); return; }

      const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries)=>{
        entries.forEach(e=>{
          if(e.isIntersecting){ e.target.classList.add('reveal'); e.target.classList.remove('hidden'); io.unobserve(e.target); }
        });
      },{threshold:0.12});

      els.forEach(el=> io.observe(el));
    })();

    // Simple contact form handler (local only)
    (function(){
      const btn = document.getElementById('sendBtn');
      btn.addEventListener('click',function(){
        const name = document.getElementById('name').value.trim();
        const email = document.getElementById('email').value.trim();
        const msg = document.getElementById('message').value.trim();
        if(!name || !email){ btn.textContent='Enter name & email'; setTimeout(()=>btn.textContent='Send request',1400); return; }
        btn.textContent='Request noted';
        setTimeout(()=>btn.textContent='Send request',1500);
        // local demo: create mailto link for convenience
        const subject = encodeURIComponent('Contact request from ' + name);
        const body = encodeURIComponent('Name: ' + name + '\nEmail: ' + email + '\nPhone: ' + document.getElementById('phone').value + '\n\nMessage:\n' + msg);
        window.location.href = 'mailto:{{EMAIL}}?subject=' + subject + '&body=' + body;
      });
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page and usage

This bundle contains the contact page and documentation for the aromatherapy practice site.

Files included:
- contact.html — Complete contact page with session planner widget and scroll-triggered reveals.

Key features implemented:
- Session Planner: interactive client-facing tool that composes a concise, plaintext session summary based on selected goal, duration, scent profile, and safety notes. Includes a Copy button and pre-composed mailto link for quick sharing.
- Scroll-triggered reveals: sections marked with data-reveal reveal on scroll using IntersectionObserver. Respects user's prefers-reduced-motion setting (disables reveal animation when reduced motion is requested).
- Safety-forward language: all plan text uses conservative phrasing ("may support") and includes dilution and patch-test guidance. FAQ includes notes on pregnancy, pets, and medical boundaries.
- No external dependencies or assets required. All behavior and visuals are local to the page.

Accessibility and progressive enhancement:
- prefers-reduced-motion respected in both CSS and JS.
- Buttons and interactive elements use semantic elements; the planner output uses aria-live for polite updates.
- The copy operation uses the Clipboard API with a fallback to document.execCommand when available.

Local testing:
1. Place contact.html in a folder served by any static server or open directly in a browser.
2. Edit placeholders in the file: {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}} as needed.
3. Interact with the Session Planner: choose options, click "Compose plan", then Copy or use the Email link.

Notes for integration:
- The planner composes general recommendations but avoids medical claims. Further tailoring should be performed during practitioner intake.
- If you maintain an assets folder for a unique SVG pattern, the page's visual uses an inline decorative SVG and will not require additional files.

If you need the rest of the site files (index.html, services.html, blends.html, shop.html, pricing.html, about.html, book.html) or an assets pattern file, request the next chunk and they will be provided with matching design and behavior."}
BUNDLE_END
